                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Remember those lousy Japanese fighting games from the 90's? The ones with terrible voice acting, bad translation, and jiggling boobs everywhere? Space Fist is one of those, but for VR. It's an odd mix of exciting, frustrating, and unintentionally hilarious. Thrill of the Fight might be the better shadowboxing game, but this is still fun for the flailing and badly-done dialogue.\n\nProbably buy it on sale.",
